| 1M | 6.79 (asym var) | 6.25–6.94 (p95 7.17) | 40.28 (asym var) | 40.19–40.42 (p95 40.88) | **5.94x** | 84.62 | 3.973308e-17 | WIN | 517.95ms |
| 12748986 | 30.69 (asym var) | 22.43–31.85 (p95 32.25) | 274.53 (asym var) | 273.30–280.12 (p95 293.81) | **8.95x** | 33.06 | 4.601065e-14 | WIN | 6219.46ms |

